"WU106M V1.0" and "20110802" is silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos. :''Haoliyuan (Shenzhen) Electronic'' is the presumed manufactuer of this device.
This device is almost certainly (also?) sold as the [[Dynamode WL-700-MRT2]].
